abstract: >-
  Maple worksheets and a MATLAB script for the quasinormal modes of scalar, electromagnetic and vector-type
  gravitational perturbations of the noncommutative geometry-inspired Schwarzschild black hole, non-extremal and
  extremal. The radial equation is compactified, its quasinormal boundary conditions are built into a factorisation of
  the solution, and a Chebyshev collocation at 200 digits gives a quadratic eigenvalue problem solved with polyeig.
